{"title": "Swathed in Shadow", "pageid": 28373, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Swathed_in_Shadow", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Swathed in Shadow</b> is a passive feature. It allows the wearer to better resist spells while in shadow.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a> by shadow, the wearer gains +1 to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> when attacked.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_Justiciar_Helmet_Magic_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_Justiciar_Helmet_Magic_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_Justiciar_Helmet_Magic_Passive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Helm\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Helm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Dark_Justiciar_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Helm\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Helm\">Dark Justiciar Helm</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The Swathed in Shadow passive adds its saving throw bonus at all times, not just when attacked and in shadow.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714220452\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited nod